  "editor_coverage": [
    "Idle empty marked text preserves both text and reversed service selection. With active preedit it ends composition and publishes no application commit; repeated empties remain idempotent. A later nonempty composition can confirm once normally.",
    "The native adapter does not forward idle empty markers to TextfieldModel, which would otherwise delete an existing selection. Every native SetCompositionText call is callback-suppressed, independently of whether the native model still reports composition afterward.",
    "The Rust adapter maps an empty platform marker to cancellation before starting/reusing a transaction. Its lower-level model still supports empty transactional preedit internally; no Rust model semantics or editing model are duplicated.",
    "Accessible normal fields return a successful composition-range query with InvalidRange after termination, matching native Views. Read-only fields reject the query. HasCompositionText is false and a subsequent ConfirmCompositionText returns zero without notifying.",
    "The shared new case exercises real adapters/IME APIs and an uncommitted empty emoji draft with a previously saved emoji. Empty marker cancellation cannot auto-save a deletion; an idle marker also preserves a selected saved emoji. Existing actual Cocoa typing/commands/navigation and broader UI cases remain in the full suite."
  ],
